  "solution": "Given equation: 12 + 66 ÷ 11 − 4 × 91 = 159.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 12 + 66 ÷ 11 − 4 × 91 = 159\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 12 + 66 × 11 − __**4 ÷ 91**__ = 159\n\n⇒ 12 + __**66 **____**×**____** 11**__ − 0.04 = 159\n\n⇒ __**12 + 726**__ − 0.04 = 159\n\n⇒ __**738 - 0.04**__ = 159\n\n⇒ 737.96 ≠ 159\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and −\n\nGiven: 12 + 66 ÷ 11 − 4 × 91 = 159\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 12 - __**66 ÷ 11**__ + 4 × 91 = 159\n\n⇒ 12 - 6 + __**4 × 91**__ = 159\n\n⇒ __**12**__ - 6 __**+ 364**__ = 159\n\n⇒ 376 - 6 = 159\n\n⇒ 370 ≠ 159\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) + and ×**\n\nGiven: 12 + 66 ÷ 11 − 4 × 91 = 159\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 12 × __**66 ÷ 11**__ − 4 + 91 = 159\n\n⇒ __**12 ×**____** 6**__ − 4 + 91 = 159\n\n⇒ __**72**__ − 4 __**+ 91**__ = 159\n\n⇒ __**163 - 4**__ = 159\n\n⇒ **159 = 159**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 12 + 66 ÷ 11 − 4 × 91 = 159\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 66**__ + 11 − 4 × 91 = 159\n\n⇒ 0.18 + 11 − __**4 × 91**__ = 159\n\n⇒ __**0.18 +**____** 11**__ − 364 = 159\n\n⇒ __**11.18**____** − 364**__ = 159\n\n⇒ 352.82 ≠ 159\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
